#: lms/djangoapps/courseware/views/views.py:2062
msgid ""
"We plan to use this information to evaluate your application for financial assistance and to further develop our financial assistance program. \n"
"Please note that while assistance is available in most courses that offer verified certificates, a few courses and programs are not eligible. You must complete a separate application for each course you take. You may be approved for financial assistance five (5) times each year (based on 12-month period from you first approval). \n"
"To apply for financial assistance: \n"
"1. Enroll in the audit track for an eligible course that offers Verified Certificates. \n"
"2. Complete this application. \n"
"3. Check your email, please allow 4 weeks for your application to be processed."
msgstr ""
"Biz ushbu ma'lumotlardan moliyaviy yordam olish uchun arizangizni baholash va moliyaviy yordam dasturimizni yanada rivojlantirish uchun foydalanishni rejalashtirmoqdamiz.\n"
" E'tibor bering, tasdiqlangan sertifikatlarni taklif qiladigan ko'pgina kurslarda yordam mavjud bo'lsa-da, bir nechta kurslar va dasturlar mos emas. Siz o'qiyotgan har bir kurs uchun alohida ariza to'ldirishingiz kerak. Siz har yili besh (5) marta moliyaviy yordam olish uchun ruxsat olishingiz mumkin (birinchi ruxsatingizdan boshlab 12 oylik muddat asosida).\n"
" Moliyaviy yordam olish uchun murojaat qilish uchun:\n"
" 1. Tasdiqlangan sertifikatlarni taklif qiladigan tegishli kurs uchun audit trekka yoziling.\n"
" 2. Ushbu ilovani to'ldiring.\n"
" 3. Elektron pochtangizni tekshiring, arizangizni ko'rib chiqish uchun 4 hafta vaqt bering."

